    "body": "The test also uses `<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//\" \"\">` which triggers quirks mode in Chromium and WebKit but limited-quirks in Gecko and Servo. The spec was changed in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12084\r\n\r\nThe test should have a non-empty system identifier to properly test limited-quirks mode.",
